&lt;div&gt;Pinterest is an equal opportunity employer and makes employment decisions on the basis of merit. We want to have the best qualified people in every job. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, ancestry, national origin, religion or religious creed, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, age, marital status, status as a protected veteran, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information or characteristics (or those of a family member) or any other consideration made unlawful by applicable federal, state or local laws. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. If you require a medical or religious accommodation during the job application process, please complete&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/sS24D4WboEKUZMQK6&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt; for support.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;By submitting this application, I certify that all information submitted in my application and throughout the hiring process is true, accurate, and complete to the best of my knowledge. I understand that any false statement, omission, or misrepresentation may disqualify me from employment consideration or result in termination if discovered after hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team of Relationship Managers and become part of an impactful and dynamic environment. Our team plays a central role at Raisin, responsible for fostering partnerships with our platforms’ partner banks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Partnership Manager, you&#39;ll play a crucial role in driving Raisin&#39;s growth across Europe and the UK. Your primary mission is to cultivate and oversee daily interactions with Raisin&#39;s partner banks, and to lead or support managing key accounts. Beyond that, you&#39;ll spearhead the launch of new products,&amp;nbsp; integration of new banks into Raisin&#39;s and our B2B partners&#39; marketplaces, and improving their technical integration with us to ensure scalability and the growth of the banks’ assets under management and ultimately the Raisin platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our far-reaching impact and diverse stakeholders, we have a comprehensive view of platform-wide evolutions, and others depend on your ability to communicate these changes and their broader implications. We are ultimately accountable for owning and managing our partner banks, taking direct responsibility for the performance and reporting of those partners and bringing new savings products to the consumer market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To excel in this role, you should be adept at managing senior stakeholders, both internally and externally. We’re a high growth fintech business, so the ability to work on multiple relationships and ad-hoc projects concurrently is key.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Partnership Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will serve as a commercial lead and strategic advisor for our portfolio of partner banks in the UK and Europe. Moving beyond traditional relationship management, this role requires a consultative, balance-sheet-first mindse&lt;strong&gt;t&lt;/strong&gt; to help executive banking leadership solve liquidity, capital, and deposit-funding challenges using Raisin&#39;s platform technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C-Suite Advisory &amp;amp; Partner Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary strategic contact for Treasury Heads, Chief Financial Officers, and C-suite banking executives, aligning Raisin&#39;s platform capabilities with their balance sheet, liquidity, and cost-of-funding objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Strategy &amp;amp; Portfolio Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively structure, negotiate, and execute commercial growth strategies to scale partner Assets Under Management (AUM) and launch new deposit product lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving &amp;amp; Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex, multi-stakeholder workstreams across internal cross-functional teams (Solutions Engineering, Legal, Compliance, Operations) to ensure seamless bank onboarding and technical integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Market Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive priority commercial initiatives across the UK and EEA markets, identifying opportunities to launch adjacent financial products and expand strategic partner coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Positioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish yourself as a trusted commercial advisor to executive leadership across your assigned bank portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AUM &amp;amp; Portfolio Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver measurable deposit growth by optimizing bank partner pricing, funding targets, and market positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flawless Program Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Successfully lead complex bank integration and product launch milestones on schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Top-tier Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Finance, Economics, Business Administration, or a related quantitative discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Background:&lt;/strong&gt; 3–6+ years of experience in Management Consulting&amp;nbsp;or Investment Banking&amp;nbsp;or Strategic Partnerships within a B2B Fintech/BaaS scale-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong command of bank balance sheets, deposit mechanics, regulatory frameworks, and commercial deal structuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Communication &amp;amp; Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional capability to translate complex financial and technical concepts into structured executive presentations for bank leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Stakeholder Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated track record of leading complex, multi-variable projects autonomously in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with UK/EEA banking regulations (FCA, BaFin), liquidity coverage ratios (LCR), or BaaS/Open Banking infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transaction, M&amp;amp;A, treasury, or advisory experience working directly with UK and European retail or commercial banks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of £1,700 and 4 full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Always hungry? Breakfast, snacks, daily fresh fruit and drinks are at your disposal around the clock.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are hybrid working, we are in the office twice a week, giving the team the opportunity to collaborate and spend time together. Wednesday is our core day in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer 28 days + Bank Holidays of holiday a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One day birthday leave to celebrate your birthday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer you a company stakeholder pension with a minimum employer contribution of 5%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to experience our annual retreats in exciting European cities and other team building events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;En tant que stagiaire SDR, vous participerez activement à l&#39;essor de notre activité en France, en augmentant la présence des professionnels de santé sur Doctolib et en leur fournissant des solutions adaptées à leurs besoins. Les équipes SDR ont pour rôle de générer des opportunités avec les soignants intéressés par nos produits via notre site internet, tels que : Doctolib Patient, Doctolib Téléconsultation et Doctolib Médecin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer l&#39;équipe Inside Sales de Doctolib, c&#39;est intégrer :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;une grande équipe de 250 personnes passionnées&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;une équipe dynamique et soudée avec fort esprit d’équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une réelle école de vente avec la Doctolib Sales Academy, qui vous forme au cycle de vente complet et vous apprend à répondre à des objections.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vos responsabilités incluent, mais ne sont pas limitées à :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre à jour et organiser les informations des prospects dans notre outil CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler en partenariat avec les équipes support et produit pour assurer la satisfaction des utilisateurs tout au long de leur parcours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Générer des opportunités pour nos équipes commerciales en contactant de futurs utilisateurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assister aux réunions d’équipe et participer à des sessions de formation continue avec votre manager pour améliorer vos compétences dans le domaine commercial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les qualités attendues pour ce poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avant de poursuivre votre lecture, si vous n&#39;avez pas le profil exact décrit ci-dessous, mais que vous pensez que cette description de poste correspond à vos compétences et à vos besoins, nous vous encourageons tout de même à postuler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous pourrez être le/ la prochain(e) membre de notre équipe si :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes à la recherche d&#39;un&lt;strong&gt; stage de fin d&#39;études&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une très bonne communication à l&#39;oral comme à l&#39;écrit, en français, et un bon niveau en anglais&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes doté(e) d’un très bon relationnel et possédez un fort esprit d’équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez envie d’apprendre, et vous recherchez à intégrer une entreprise à vrai impact social avec laquelle vous pourrez apprendre et vous développer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faire preuve d’empathie et avoir une capacité d’écoute attentive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoir un fort sens de l’organisation et de l’efficacité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ce serait fantastique si :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une première expérience dans l&#39;univers de la vente&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une appétence pour le domaine de la santé&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre offre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme d’onboarding complet, avec la Doctolib Academy et de nombreuses sessions de formation au sein de votre équipe (langues, soft skills, compétences techniques)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une carte Swile et de nombreuses offres de restauration au sein de nos locaux&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une offre de sport : un abonnement Urban Sports Club, des cours de sport gratuits dans les bureaux ou à distance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le remboursement des titres de transport à 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De nombreux bureaux offrant des espaces de collaboration et de bien-être&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une politique de travail flexible avec un mode hybride&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Le processus de recrutement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un call RH avec Aya, Talent Partner (15 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un entretien opérationnel avec Sixtine, Responsable de l&#39;équipe SDR (45 minutes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Détails du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage conventionné à temps plein&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Horaires : &lt;strong&gt;Plage horaire de 7h30 à 13h30 ou de 14h à 20h&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Durée : 6 mois&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Début souhaité :&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;6 janvier 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lieu : Levallois-Perret&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gratification : À définir selon niveau d’études&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Doctolib, nous sommes convaincus que nous devons améliorer la santé pour tout le monde. Cela se reflète dans notre processus de recrutement. Nous évaluons les candidatures uniquement sur la base des qualifications et de la motivation, sans aucune forme de discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plus les idées sont diverses, plus notre produit améliorera véritablement la santé pour tout le monde. Vous pouvez postuler chez Doctolib, quel que soit votre genre, religion, âge, orientation sexuelle, origine ethnique ou handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Afin de garantir l&#39;égalité des chances, nous vous invitons à exclure les informations personnelles (par exemple : photos, âge) de vos candidatures. Si vous avez besoin d&#39;aménagements particuliers, merci de nous en informer pour que nous puissions adapter le processus de recrutement. Rejoignez-nous pour construire la santé dont nous rêvons tous !&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Toutes les informations fournies sont traitées par Doctolib pour la gestion des candidatures. Pour plus de détails sur le traitement des données, cliquez&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;ici&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Veuillez contacter hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com pour toute question ou pour exercer vos droits.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Senior MLOps Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;ML Platform&lt;/strong&gt; team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your mission will be to build and scale the infrastructure that brings machine learning to life at Doctolib — powering AI-driven solutions that improve the daily experience of care teams and patients across Europe. You will work in a cross-functional team developing the ML platform and tooling that underpins Doctolib&#39;s AI products, contributing directly to faster, more reliable deployment of models that have a real impact on healthcare delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Build and deploy production-grade machine learning models in close collaboration with data scientists and engineers, ensuring performance, scalability, and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Design and maintain the MLOps pipeline, including version control, CI/CD, and monitoring of ML models in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Develop tools, frameworks, and best practices to streamline the model development and deployment lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Ensure the availability and performance of ML systems, proactively identifying and resolving issues before they impact users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to gather requirements, provide technical guidance, and contribute to the development of end-to-end ML solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Share and advocate MLOps knowledge across the tech community, documenting processes, standards, and best practices to drive consistency and knowledge transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Are proficient in Python, SQL, Shell Scripting, and Terraform, with hands-on experience building and containerizing ML pipelines with Docker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have solid knowledge of cloud platforms, particularly AWS services such as SageMaker, EC2, ECS, S3, and CloudWatch (and/or Azure equivalents)&lt;/li&gt;
