&lt;li&gt;Experience with Cloud Native environments (AWS), Containers and Terraform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience with DAST, SAST, SCA tools, reporting and dashboarding platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
